This Haxe port of Oniguruma 6.9.8 and vscode-oniguruma 2.0.1 keeps the terms
of both projects: the code translated from Oniguruma (src/oniguruma/onig) is
under the BSD-2-Clause license of Oniguruma, the code translated from
vscode-oniguruma (src/oniguruma) is under the MIT license of vscode-oniguruma.
The Unicode tables (src/oniguruma/onig/UnicodeData.hx) are generated from
Oniguruma's tables, which are derived from the Unicode Character Database
(Unicode 14.0), covered by the Unicode license below.

